Package: owdata
Title: Index of openwashdata R Data Packages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lars", "Schöbitz", , "lschoebitz@ethz.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2196-5015"))
Description: Ships a harvested catalog of the openwashdata R data
    packages, their datasets and their variables, with accessor and search
    functions across the whole catalog and an installer that points at the
    openwashdata R-universe. The catalog is regenerated weekly by an
    automated harvest of the openwashdata GitHub organisation.
License: CC BY 4.0
URL: https://github.com/openwashdata/owdata,
    https://openwashdata.github.io/owdata/
BugReports: https://github.com/openwashdata/owdata/issues
